# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vibeful Homes — example environment file (NO SECRETS)
#
# This demo app has NO required environment variables. It uses no
# database, no backend API and no external API keys. Everything is
# stored in the browser's localStorage.
#
# The optional variable below only affects SEO metadata (canonical /
# Open Graph URLs). Leave it unset for local development.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

# Optional: public site URL used for metadata on your Vercel deployment.
# Example:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://your-domain.vercel.app
